{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1549","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1549/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1549/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1549/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1549","id":1242202067,"node_id":"I_kwDOBM4HkM5KCn_T","number":1549,"title":"Are Open5GS Network Functions Stateless?","user":{"login":"0x41gawor","id":54957423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU3NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54957423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor","html_url":"https://github.com/0x41gawor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":529908693,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1Mjk5MDg2OTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/labels/Help%20Wanted","name":"Help Wanted","color":"128A0C","default":false,"description":"Maintainers are not working on this issue so community help is wanted.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-05-19T19:03:39Z","updated_at":"2022-05-23T11:33:48Z","closed_at":"2022-05-23T11:33:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Why am I asking?**\r\nI want to dockerize Open5GS services and deploy them as containers. Then use Kubernetes for orchestration.\r\n**Why do I care about statelessness?**\r\nI am concerned if Open5GS Network Functions deployed as a container inside a K8s Pod, lose computing data (e.g. UE Context in AMF) during Pod recreation (which means killing the service process and starting the container again). \r\n**How do I understand the statelessness?**\r\nhttps://www.redhat.com/en/topics/cloud-native-apps/stateful-vs-stateless Stateless app acts only as a computing unit, and the data it operates on (e.g. PDU session in UPF) is stored externally on some database. I know that the current transactions must be lost, but what about the state of UE session - is it stored in local process memory or in some kind of database, where the recreated Pod would have access to?\r\n\r\nIf I am wrong and misunderstood some concepts, feel free to correct me.","closed_by":{"login":"0x41gawor","id":54957423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU3NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54957423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor","html_url":"https://github.com/0x41gawor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x41gawor/repos","events_url":"h